S='https://www.safe.gov.cn/tianjin/2024/0430/2464.html'
W='https://www.safe.gov.cn/shanghai/2019/0215/988.html'
F='https://www.safe.gov.cn/tianjin/2024/0621/2529.html'
D='https://english.www.gov.cn/policies/latestreleases/201912/31/content_WS5e0b367fc6d07ec821d3ea7a.html'
I='https://www.irs.gov/publications/p54'
B='https://www.irs.gov/businesses/small-businesses-self-employed/report-of-foreign-bank-and-financial-accounts-fbar'
